  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Policy advisor with a focus on the EU&apos;s method development in the implementation of
strategies and initiatives in support of civil society. The work includes support for development and relationships with foundations / philanthropists and to work for approaches that contribute to an improved environment for civilian society.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Policyr&#xe5;dgivare med fokus p&#xe5; EU:S metodutveckling i genomf&#xf6;randet av
strategier och initiativ i st&#xf6;det till det civila samh&#xe4;llet. Arbetet omfattar st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r utveckling och relationer med stiftelser/filantroper samt att verka f&#xf6;r ansatser som bidrar till en f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrad milj&#xf6; f&#xf6;r civila samh&#xe4;llet.</narrative>
  </description>
